  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 504.04 Required Stage I System Inspections and Maintenance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 504.04 Required Stage I System Inspections and Maintenance. The owner or operator of a gasoline dispensing facility that is subject to this part shall:\n\n(a) Conduct monthly maintenance inspections of all stage I equipment at the facility as specified in RSA 146-C:19, II, reprinted in Appendix D, for monthly inspections;\n\n(b) Conduct an annual maintenance inspection of all stage I equipment at the facility as specified in Env-Or 504.05;\n\n(c) Maintain stage I equipment as specified by the manufacturer or the applicable reference standard specified in Env-Or 509; and\n\n(d) Maintain all stage I equipment, except PV vent caps, to be leak free and vapor tight.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or500.html"
